#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/content/GceRentIncreaseLimitsContent.tsx:29
msgid ""
"If you are offered a new lease after April 20th, 2024, then your landlord "
"can’t raise your apartment’s monthly rent higher than:"
msgstr ""
"Si se le ofrece un nuevo contrato de arrendamiento después del 20 de abril "
"de 2024, entonces el propietario no puede aumentar el alquiler mensual de su"
" apartamento por encima de:"

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/content/RsLeaseRenewalContent.tsx:10
msgid ""
"If you are rent-stabilized your landlord cannot simply decide they don’t "
"want you as a tenant anymore, they are limited to certain reasons for "
"evicting you."
msgstr ""
"Si tiene el alquiler estabilizado, su propietario no puede simplemente "
"decidir que ya no lo quiere como inquilino, sino que se limita a ciertas "
"razones para desalojarlo."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/content/RsSuccessionContent.tsx:10
msgid ""
"If you are the immediate family member of a rent-stabilized tenant and have "
"been living with them immediately prior to their moving or passing away, you"
" might be entitled to take over the lease."
msgstr ""
"Si usted es el familiar inmediato de un inquilino con alquiler estabilizado "
"y ha estado viviendo con ellos inmediatamente antes de su mudanza o "
"fallecimiento, es posible que tenga derecho a hacerse cargo del contrato de "
"arrendamiento."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrDhcrComplaintContent.tsx:21
msgid ""
"If you believe you’ve been charged more than the legal rent for your "
"apartment, you may be able to file an overcharge complaint with DHCR. DHCR "
"can review the evidence, determine whether an overcharge occurred, and order"
" an appropriate remedy when it finds a violation."
msgstr ""
"Si crees que te han cobrado más que el alquiler legal de tu apartamento, es "
"posible que puedas presentar una queja por sobrecargo ante el Departamento. "
"Puede revisar las pruebas, determinar si se ha producido un sobrecargo y "
"ordenar un recurso apropiado cuando encuentre una infracción."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/assertYourRightsSections.tsx:73
msgid ""
"If you believe your landlord has violated your rights, you may be able to "
"take formal action."
msgstr ""
"Si cree que su propietario ha violado sus derechos, es posible que pueda "
"tomar medidas formales."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrWithholdRentContent.tsx:29
msgid ""
"If you choose to withhold rent, consider setting your monthly rent money "
"aside while you withhold. If a court later determines that you owe some or "
"all of the withheld rent, having the money available can be important."
msgstr ""
"Si decides retener el alquiler, considera reservar el dinero de tu alquiler "
"mensual mientras lo haces. Si un tribunal determina más tarde que usted debe"
" parte o la totalidad del alquiler retenido, puede ser importante tener el "
"dinero disponible."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrWithholdRentContent.tsx:26
msgid "If you decide to withhold rent"
msgstr "Si decides retener el alquiler"

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/content/RsStabilizedLeaseContent.tsx:73
msgid ""
"If you don’t have a lease, or your lease doesn’t say that your apartment is "
"rent stabilized, you may still have the rights and protections that come "
"with rent stabilization."
msgstr ""
"Si no tiene un contrato de arrendamiento, o su contrato de arrendamiento no "
"dice que su apartamento está estabilizado, es posible que aún tenga los "
"derechos y protecciones que vienen con la estabilización de alquileres."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/assertYourRightsSections.tsx:106
msgid ""
"If you live in a rent stabilized apartment, there are additional programs "
"you can use to try to reduce or limit your rent."
msgstr ""
"Si vives en un apartamento de alquiler estabilizado, hay programas "
"adicionales que puedes usar para tratar de reducir o limitar tu alquiler."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/knowYourRightsSections.tsx:45
msgid ""
"If you live in a rent-stabilized apartment, or think your apartment should "
"be rent stabilized, you may have additional protections around your rent and"
" ability to remain in your home."
msgstr ""
"Si vives en un apartamento con alquiler estabilizado o crees que tu "
"apartamento debería tener un alquiler estabilizado, es posible que tengas "
"protecciones adicionales en torno a tu alquiler y la capacidad de permanecer"
" en tu hogar."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrRentReductionCheckContent.tsx:14
msgid ""
"If you’re concerned about your rent, finding out whether there is an "
"existing order can give you important context before you decide what to do."
msgstr ""
"Si te preocupa tu alquiler, averiguar si hay un pedido existente puede darte"
" un contexto importante antes de decidir qué hacer."

#: src/Components/Pages/Landing/Landing.tsx:31
msgid ""
"If your apartment is rent stabilized, or has ever been rent stabilized, you "
"should have a rent history document."
msgstr ""

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/content/RsStabilizedLeaseContent.tsx:18
msgid ""
"If your apartment is rent stabilized, your landlord must give you a rent-"
"stabilized lease. Your lease should tell you that your apartment is rent "
"stabilized and provide information about your rent and the terms of your "
"tenancy."
msgstr ""
"Si su apartamento está estabilizado en cuanto al alquiler, el propietario "
"debe otorgarle un contrato de arrendamiento estabilizado en cuanto al "
"alquiler. Su contrato de arrendamiento debe indicarle que su apartamento "
"está estabilizado y proporcionar información sobre su alquiler y los "
"términos de su arrendamiento."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrAskLandlordContent.tsx:72
msgid ""
"If your concern involves something that happened before your landlord became"
" the owner, don’t assume that you have no recourse simply because the "
"current owner wasn’t involved at the time."
msgstr ""
"Si su preocupación involucra algo que sucedió antes de que su propietario se"
" convirtiera en el propietario, no asuma que no tiene ningún recurso "
"simplemente porque el propietario actual no estaba involucrado en ese "
"momento."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/knowYourRightsSections.tsx:52
msgid ""
"If your lease looks <0>something like this</0>, then your apartment is very "
"likely rent stabilized. But even if your lease does not look like that, you "
"may still be rent stabilized."
msgstr ""
"Si su contrato de arrendamiento se ve <0>algo como esto</0>, entonces es muy"
" probable que su apartamento esté estabilizado. Pero incluso si su contrato "
"de arrendamiento no se ve así, es posible que aún esté estabilizado."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrNeighborsContent.tsx:30
msgid ""
"If your neighbors are facing similar problems, you can work together to "
"document what is happening, raise concerns with your landlord, contact "
"government agencies, or take action as a group. When tenants come together, "
"you have power."
msgstr ""
"Si sus vecinos se enfrentan a problemas similares, pueden trabajar juntos "
"para documentar lo que está sucediendo, plantear inquietudes al propietario,"
" ponerse en contacto con las agencias gubernamentales o tomar medidas como "
"grupo. Cuando los inquilinos se unen, tienes poder."

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/KnowYourRights/content/NychaGrieveContent.tsx:10
msgid ""
"In instances where residents disagree with management decisions or believe "
"their rights have been violated, they have the right to grieve these issues "
"through a formal process. Residents can file grievances online through the "
"resident portal or on paper by visiting the management office."
msgstr ""
"En los casos en que los residentes no estén de acuerdo con las decisiones de"
" la administración o crean que se han violado sus derechos, tienen derecho a"
" lamentar estos problemas a través de un proceso formal. Los residentes "
"pueden presentar quejas en línea a través del portal para residentes o en "
"papel visitando la oficina de administración."

#: src/Components/Pages/AccountPage/AccountPage.tsx:268
msgid "In progress"
msgstr ""

#: src/Components/Pages/RightsPages/AssertYourRights/content/AyrSupremeCourtContent.tsx:18
msgid ""
"In some circumstances, a tenant may be able to bring a case in Supreme Court"
" to enforce their rights or seek money they believe they are owed. Whether "
"this is an appropriate option depends on the specific facts of your "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"En algunas circunstancias, un inquilino puede presentar un caso ante la "
"Corte Suprema para hacer valer sus derechos o buscar el dinero que cree que "
"se le debe. Si esta es una opción apropiada depende de los hechos "
"específicos de su situación."

